@startuml deployment-diagram
!include ../_style.iuml
title Cupcake App · Deployment diagram (production)
left to right direction

node "Customer / staff device" as Dev {
  artifact "Browser\n(mobile-first web app)\nlocalStorage: cart, lastOrder" as Browser
}

cloud "Vercel (project: cupcake-web)" as VW {
  node "Next.js 16 app\n(apps/web)\nServer + Client Components" as Web
}

cloud "Vercel (project: cupcake-api)" as VA {
  node "Vercel Function (Fluid compute)\nFastify 5 app (apps/api)" as Api
}

cloud "Neon (Vercel Marketplace)" as N {
  database "PostgreSQL 16\nbranch: main (production)\npooled + direct URLs" as Db
}

node "GitHub" as GH {
  artifact "Repository\n(monorepo)" as Repo
  artifact "GitHub Actions CI\n(lint, types, tests,\nPostgres service)" as CI
}

Browser --> Web : HTTPS\npages, /api/* (same origin)
Web --> Api : HTTPS\nrewrite /api/* → API_URL\n(server fetch for SSR)
Api --> Db : TLS · Prisma 7 + pg adapter\n(pooled URL)
CI ..> Db : prisma migrate deploy\n(direct URL, on release)
Repo --> CI : push / PR
Repo ..> VW : Git integration\n(preview per PR, prod on main)
Repo ..> VA : Git integration\n(preview per PR, prod on main)
@enduml
